## 📂 Repository Layout
```text
fraud-detection/
├── data/
│   └── train.csv            # 200-row synthetic highly imbalanced binary dataset
├── reports/
│   └── cv_results.json      # Structured summary output containing all 7 core metrics
└── src/
    └── models/
        └── cross_validate.py # Core MLflow production execution script
```

---

## ⚡ Core Features & Requirements Met

* **Nested Run Layout:** Groups 5 independent evaluation cycles under a single master `cv-parent` run.
* **Deterministic Class Ratios:** Implements `StratifiedKFold` to lock the target balance firmly across splits.
* **Automated Metrics Engine:** Logs per-fold calculation metrics for `accuracy_score`, `f1_score`, and `roc_auc_score`.
* **Zero Deflection Scaffold:** Runs strictly on native dependencies without custom helper imports or alteration of base configurations.

