## 🚀 Execution & Verification
To manually execute the modeling evaluation cycle and review results, enter the following commands into your environment terminal:

```bash
# Force compile missing structural directories
mkdir -p /root/code/fraud-detection/reports/

# Execute ML pipeline runner
python3 /root/code/fraud-detection/src/models/cross_validate.py

# Verify schema output rules
cat /root/code/fraud-detection/reports/cv_results.json
```
